; Reads a source file and prints every node with the source text its span
; covers. The walk over each stage's nodes lives with that stage --
; `Cst.To_span_text` and `Sst.To_span_text` -- so this is a frontend that picks
; one with `--cst` or `--sst`. test/dune diffs its output against a checked-in
; expectation for both.
(executable
 (name span_dump)
 (modules span_dump)
 (libraries cst sst))
